1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,170
Free delivery isn't free.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:06,850
You still pay for it.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,890
Master, I got shampoo, delivery is twenty thousand.

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,250
If I add forty thousand more, it's free!

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,550
Do you really need that forty-thousand thing?

6
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,220
Not really...

7
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,590
but it's free!

8
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:20,800
Quiet, Diyor.

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,940
Look.

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,790
2002, America.

11
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:38,830
The world's biggest online store cut free delivery from 99 dollars to 49, and two months later to 25.

12
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:43,550
People added more to their carts to reach the limit.

13
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:46,720
The store called it a “positive result”.

14
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,300
So they were counting on us?!

15
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:56,190
Only in France they charged one franc, about twenty cents, for delivery.

16
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,380
Sales there barely grew.

17
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:04,340
The moment they made it zero, sales grew there too.

18
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,340
Scientists tested it:

19
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,900
most people chose the expensive chocolate.

20
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:13,170
When the cheap one became “free”, everyone switched to the free one.

21
00:01:13,670 --> 00:01:18,040
So the word “free” fools the brain?

22
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:19,400
It doesn't fool it.

23
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,710
It rushes it.

24
00:01:21,210 --> 00:01:22,210
Do the math:

25
00:01:22,210 --> 00:01:26,210
you saved twenty thousand and spent forty.

26
00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:27,730
Three rules.

27
00:01:27,730 --> 00:01:29,550
Buy only what you need.

28
00:01:29,550 --> 00:01:34,020
Put things you'll buy soon anyway into one order.

29
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:34,630
And ask:

30
00:01:34,630 --> 00:01:38,080
would I buy this if delivery weren't paid?

31
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:45,220
They don't sell you delivery, they sell you the feeling of “free”.

32
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,480
Always ask:

33
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,010
who profits from this?

34
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:53,560
Send your cart and the delivery terms to our bot:

35
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,450
@sahiychishopbot.

36
00:01:54,450 --> 00:02:00,970
It works out how much extra you pay for free delivery and what you can remove.

